<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="YuneMusic" pubkey="" timestamp="1792866952" url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quompacc/yunemusic/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Official repository of YuneMusic, an ad-free music player for YouTube content. Source code: https://github.com/quompacc/yunemusic</description></repo><application id="io.github.quompacc.yunemusic"><id>io.github.quompacc.yunemusic</id><added>2026-10-24</added><lastupdated>2026-10-24</lastupdated><name>YuneMusic</name><summary>Ad-free music player for YouTube content. No account, no API key, no tracking.</summary><desc>&lt;p&gt;YuneMusic is a lightweight music player that streams music from YouTube without a Google account or API key. All data is fetched via the open source &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipeExtractor&quot;&gt;NewPipe Extractor&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background playback with notification and media button controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offline buffer: preloads up to five minutes and the next two tracks, with a self-managed 256 MB audio cache (respects &quot;Wi-Fi only&quot;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android Auto support with browse categories (liked, history, queue)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local taste profile based on listening history, likes and skips – computed on the device only&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal sessions and Smart Radio for continuous playback of related tracks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shuffle, repeat and full queue management including drag-to-reorder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Library with liked songs, history and downloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplified car mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Privacy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Likes, history and the taste profile are stored locally only. Search, streaming and cover requests are sent to YouTube and its content delivery services, which therefore see your IP address.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;YuneMusic is not affiliated with YouTube or Google.&lt;/p&gt;
